# This machine's global npm config points at a private AWS CodeArtifact registry
# belonging to an unrelated project, whose token is expired. Pinning the public
# registry here keeps `npm install` working for this repo without touching the
# developer's global config - and means a reviewer, a CI runner or Vercel all
# resolve the same packages regardless of what their own npm is set to.
registry=https://registry.npmjs.org/
